##### StemStack  
*solo / duo* 

Dual-zone chambers mist stems mid-way and briefly flood roots, producing ultra-crisp celery, water spinach and kohlrabi bulbs.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Roots & stems – Compact Celery, Water Spinach Stem, Baby Kohlrabi  

